+            // records (pad3==0). The interaction fill above only covers LIT
+            // pixels; an UNLIT opaque wall is a pass record with no interaction,
+            // so without this its depth stays at the cleared far value (1.0) and
+            // the sky — drawn in the final pass at its real depth with LessEqual
